CLAUDE.md

# Ship node-pty — the embedded terminal's native module. `node_modules/**` above
# excludes everything; the negations below re-include ONLY this one package's
# runtime bits. vsce force-includes anything matching a `!` pattern regardless
# of later rules, so each negation is scoped tightly — no `.pdb` debug symbols
# (~28 MB), no TS sources, no install scripts, no third_party/ (its only job is
# to populate build/Release/conpty during install, which is already committed).
!node_modules/@homebridge/node-pty-prebuilt-multiarch/package.json
!node_modules/@homebridge/node-pty-prebuilt-multiarch/LICENSE
!node_modules/@homebridge/node-pty-prebuilt-multiarch/lib/**/*.js
!node_modules/@homebridge/node-pty-prebuilt-multiarch/typings/**
!node_modules/@homebridge/node-pty-prebuilt-multiarch/build/Release/*.node
!node_modules/@homebridge/node-pty-prebuilt-multiarch/build/Release/*.dll
!node_modules/@homebridge/node-pty-prebuilt-multiarch/build/Release/*.exe
!node_modules/@homebridge/node-pty-prebuilt-multiarch/build/Release/conpty/**
!node_modules/@homebridge/node-pty-prebuilt-multiarch/prebuilds/**
